          "distinct": true,
          "id": "922422c6ccb2d65ff4bfd503c8e543ff3f29dc6a",
          "message": "docs(sdk): add advanced implementation patterns and examples (#213)\n\n- Created comprehensive guide covering tiered pricing calculation,\n  multi-provider plugin architecture, FallbackHint orchestration,\n  cost aggregation strategies, and performance optimization patterns\n- Added runnable Go examples in `examples/advanced/` demonstrating\n  TieredPricingCalculator and provider-specific property extraction\n  using the mapping package\n- Examples use structured logging (slog) consistent with project patterns\n\n- [x] `go build ./examples/advanced/...` compiles successfully\n- [x] `go run ./examples/advanced/tieredpricing/ --quiet` executes\n- [x] `go run ./examples/advanced/multiprovider/ --quiet` executes\n- [x] `golangci-lint run ./examples/advanced/...` passes with 0 issues\n- [x] `npx markdownlint-cli2 docs/ADVANCED_PATTERNS.md` passes\n- [x] `go test ./...` all tests pass\n\n- `docs/ADVANCED_PATTERNS.md` - Comprehensive guide for complex plugin\n  scenarios including tiered pricing, multi-provider mapping, plugin\n  orchestration, and performance optimization\n- `examples/advanced/README.md` - Documentation for running examples\n- `examples/advanced/tieredpricing/tiered_pricing.go` - Demonstrates\n  tiered pricing calculation with AWS S3 and GCP Cloud Storage examples\n- `examples/advanced/multiprovider/multi_provider.go` - Demonstrates\n  multi-provider property extraction using mapping package\n\nCloses #185",
          "timestamp": "2025-12-29T17:10:15-06:00",
