          "distinct": true,
          "id": "45cea69ca004e4d08a0fb9c08a1ea62422c0ec9f",
          "message": "feat(pluginsdk): Add DryRun for plugin field mapping discovery (#248)\n\nEnables hosts to query plugins for their FOCUS field mapping capabilities\nwithout triggering actual cost data retrieval. Plugins can now advertise\nwhich of the ~66 FOCUS 1.2/1.3 fields they support, with statuses including\nSUPPORTED, UNSUPPORTED, CONDITIONAL (with conditions), and DYNAMIC (runtime\ndependent). Includes configuration validation and simulation parameters for\nparameterized dry-runs.\n\n- [x] All 12 DryRun conformance tests pass\n- [x] BenchmarkDryRun validates <100ms p99 latency (actual: ~440µs avg)\n- [x] `go test ./sdk/go/...` passes\n- [x] `npm run lint:markdown` passes with 0 errors\n- [x] Multi-provider examples validated (AWS, Azure, GCP, Kubernetes)\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/dry_run.go` - DryRun helpers: FocusFieldNames(),\n  NewFieldMapping(), AllFieldsWithStatus(), NewDryRunResponse()\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/dry_run_test.go` - Unit tests for dry-run helpers\n- `sdk/go/testing/dry_run_conformance_test.go` - 12 conformance tests\n- `examples/requests/dry_run/` - Multi-provider example payloads\n- `specs/032-plugin-dry-run/` - Feature specification and tasks\n\n- `proto/pulumicost/v1/costsource.proto` - Added DryRun RPC, DryRunRequest,\n  DryRunResponse, FieldMapping, FieldSupportStatus enum\n- `proto/pulumicost/v1/enums.proto` - Added FieldSupportStatus enum\n- `sdk/go/testing/mock_plugin.go` - Added DryRun support with configurable\n  field mappings, validation errors, and dry_run capability\n- `sdk/go/testing/benchmark_test.go` - Added BenchmarkDryRun functions\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/README.md` - Added comprehensive Dry Run Mode section\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Added DryRun capability documentation\n\nCloses #186",
          "timestamp": "2025-12-31T21:15:01-06:00",
