          "message": "test(pluginsdk): Add unit tests for DismissRecommendation (#254)\n\n* docs(roadmap): update Q1 2026 roadmap with completed milestones\n\n* test(pluginsdk): Add unit tests for DismissRecommendation\n\nAdds comprehensive unit tests for the DismissRecommendation RPC method,\ncovering scenarios where the plugin implements the DismissProvider\ninterface, where it does not (returning Unimplemented), and error handling cases.\n\nCloses #225",
