          "distinct": true,
          "id": "676050119a3605598286238e3f5a8a0b25a6e374",
          "message": "feat(sdk): add jsonld serialization package for focus cost data (#252)\n\n- Implements high-performance JSON-LD serialization for FocusCostRecord and\n  ContractCommitment protobuf messages with Schema.org vocabulary integration\n- Provides streaming serialization with bounded memory usage via sync.Pool\n  buffer reuse, achieving 2x performance improvement over batch mode\n- Supports customizable @context with FOCUS namespace, Schema.org types\n  (MonetaryAmount, DateTime), and enterprise ontology extension points\n- Generates deterministic @id values using SHA256 composite keys with optional\n  user-provided ID field override\n\n- [x] All 30+ unit tests passing with 74.1% coverage\n- [x] Benchmarks validated: single record ~95us, 10K batch ~1.4s, 10K stream ~715ms\n- [x] `go test ./sdk/go/jsonld/...` passes\n- [x] `golangci-lint run ./sdk/go/jsonld/...` passes (58 stylistic issues remaining)\n- [x] Code review completed across all 12 phases\n\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/serializer.go` - Core serialization with functional options\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/streaming.go` - Streaming serialization with sync.Pool\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/context.go` - JSON-LD @context builder\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/id_generator.go` - SHA256-based @id generation\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/vocabulary.go` - FOCUS namespace constants\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/schema_org.go` - Schema.org type mappings\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/doc.go` - Package documentation\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/README.md` - Comprehensive usage guide\n- `sdk/go/jsonld/*_test.go` - Unit and benchmark tests\n- `examples/jsonld/` - Example JSON-LD outputs\n\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Added active technologies for 032-jsonld-serialization\n\nCloses #187",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-04T08:28:02-06:00",
