          "distinct": true,
          "id": "bc0d4c76e5b40458fdd3dc9572053380c07d995c",
          "message": "test(sdk): fix timeout and performance verification suite (#271)\n\n## Summary\n\nRepairs the integration tests for client timeouts and performance conformance\nto correctly validate SDK Polish v0.4.15 features. The timeout tests now properly\nuse the SDK's internal server implementation with Connect protocol support,\nensuring accurate verification of the 'ClientConfig.Timeout' logic.\nLinting issues across the testing suite have also been resolved.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `TestClientTimeout_*` pass (verified Connect protocol & context precedence)\n- [x] `TestGetPluginInfoPerformance_LegacyPlugin` passes\n- [x] `make lint-go` passes with zero issues\n- [x] `make test` passes\n\n## Changes\n\n### Modified files\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/timeout_test.go` - Refactored to use `pluginsdk.Serve` and `Client`\n  for realistic timeout testing\n- `sdk/go/testing/performance_test.go` - Corrected assertions for legacy plugin performance\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/error_test.go` - Fixed linting issues (comments, unused params)\n- `sdk/go/testing/mock_legacy_plugin.go` - Fixed linting issues\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/sdk.go` - Minor formatting/lint fixes\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/client.go` - Minor formatting fixes\n\nCloses #226\nCloses #244\nCloses #245",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-11T09:35:29-06:00",
