          "message": "refactor(sdk): rename project from pulumicost to finfocus (#273)\n\n* chore: partial rename\n\n* refactor(sdk): rename project from pulumicost to finfocus\n\nComplete project rebrand implementing the FinFocus identity with the tagline\n\"Focusing your finances left.\" This rename touches all layers of the codebase\nwhile preserving backward compatibility for plugin developers through the\nretained `pbc` proto package alias.\n\nKey architectural decisions:\n\n- Proto package uses `finfocus.v1` namespace but keeps `pbc` Go alias\n- Environment variables now use `FINFOCUS_*` prefix\n- Prometheus metrics renamed to `finfocus_*` namespace\n- Trace headers updated to `x-finfocus-trace-id`\n- Version reset to v0.5.0 marking the new identity\n\n- [x] `go build ./...` passes\n- [x] `make test` passes (18 packages)\n- [x] `make generate` regenerates proto code correctly\n- [x] Markdown linting passes on updated documentation\n- [x] No unintended `pulumicost` references remain (verified with ripgrep)\n\n- `go.mod` - Module path updated to `github.com/rshade/finfocus-spec`\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/*.proto` - Package namespace and go_package options\n- `buf.yaml` - Updated ignore paths for new proto location\n- `.release-please-manifest.json` - Version reset to 0.5.0\n- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` - Updated buf breaking change reference\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/*.go` - Environment constants, metrics, trace IDs\n- `sdk/go/pricing/*.go` - Observability metric names, schema URLs\n- `sdk/go/testing/*.go` - Service path assertions\n- `sdk/go/registry/*.go` - Example URLs in tests\n\n- `README.md` - New branding, tagline, badges, and examples\n- `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `AGENTS.md` - Updated references\n- `docs/*.md` - All documentation files\n- `sdk/go/**/README.md` - SDK package documentation\n- `examples/**/*.md` - Example documentation\n\n- `package.json`, `package-lock.json` - NPM package name\n- `schemas/*.json` - Schema $id URLs\n- `examples/**/*.json` - Plugin configurations and examples\n\nCloses #272",
