          "id": "70cf93b939dc545e4fdcd24a2d649317f59a22fb",
          "message": "chore: complete FinFocus rename cleanup (#285)\n\n## Summary\n\nFinal cleanup tasks following the project rename from PulumiCost to FinFocus.\nRemoves completed migration plan and updates remaining references to establish\nthe new FinFocus identity throughout the repository.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Removed files\n- `RENAME-PLAN.md` - Migration plan completed and no longer needed\n\n### Renamed files\n- `.claude/agents/pulumicost-senior-engineer.md` → `finfocus-senior-engineer.md`\n- `.claude/agents/pulumicost-technical-writer.md` → `finfocus-technical-writer.md`\n- `.claude/agents/pulumicost-product-manager.md` → `finfocus-product-manager.md`\n\n### Modified files\n- `lefthook.yml` - Updated comment from \"pulumicost-spec\" to \"finfocus-spec\"\n- `.specify/memory/constitution.md` - Removed \"transitioning\" language, updated proto paths and repository references\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `make lint` passes (Go and buf linting)\n- [x] Agent files renamed correctly\n- [x] No broken references to renamed files",
