          "message": "feat(sdk): implement plugin capability discovery and auto-detection (#290)\n\n- Introduced a type-safe `PluginCapability` enum in the Protobuf\n  specification to formalize feature negotiation between consumers\n  and plugins.\n- Implemented zero-allocation auto-discovery in the Go SDK using\n  interface type assertions, allowing plugins to advertise features\n  like Recommendations and Budgets without manual configuration.\n- Added support for explicit capability overrides in the `PluginInfo`\n  builder to handle edge cases or custom feature reporting.\n- Maintained 100% backward compatibility by automatically populating\n  the legacy string-based metadata map from the detected capabilities.\n- Refactored the `GetPluginInfo` handler to reduce cognitive\n  complexity and improve maintainability while ensuring defensive\n  copying of configuration data.\n\n- [x] Verified auto-discovery logic in `conformance_test.go`\n- [x] Validated backward compatibility and overrides in `sdk_test.go`\n- [x] Benchmarked discovery overhead in `plugin_info_benchmark_test.go`\n- [x] `make lint` and `make validate` pass with zero issues\n- [x] `make test` passes for all SDK components\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/plugin_info_benchmark_test.go` - Performance\n  validation for auto-discovery logic.\n- `specs/036-capability-enum/` - Design specification, implementation\n  plan, and research artifacts.\n\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/enums.proto` - Added `PluginCapability` enum.\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.proto` - Added `capabilities` field to\n  `GetPluginInfoResponse`.\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/plugin_info.go` - Implemented `inferCapabilities`\n  and capability options.\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/sdk.go` - Refactored `GetPluginInfo` and added\n  auto-discovery integration.\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/env.go` - Refactored environment variable\n  handling for better consistency.\n- `PLUGIN_DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md` - Updated documentation for\n  capability discovery.\n\nCloses #287",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-15T05:44:33-06:00",
