          "distinct": true,
          "id": "fea88745db9a714b7e1c6457090d12690df8e14d",
          "message": "feat(sdk): implement granular capability discovery in supports rpc (#291)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Enhanced the `Supports` RPC to return a strongly-typed list of\n  capabilities supported for specific resources.\n- Implemented automatic capability population in the Go SDK using\n  interface introspection, complementing the global discovery.\n- Formalized the dual-layer discovery protocol (Global vs Granular)\n  to enable more precise feature negotiation between Hosts and Plugins.\n- Maintained backward compatibility with the legacy string-based\n  capability map in `SupportsResponse`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Added `TestSupports_AutoDiscovery` to verify SDK population.\n- [x] Verified `GetPluginInfo` still works as expected.\n- [x] `make lint` passes with zero issues.\n- [x] `make test` passes for all SDK components.\n\n## Changes\n\n### New files\n\n- `specs/037-dual-layer-capability-discovery/spec.md` - Protocol spec.\n\n### Modified files\n\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.proto` - Added `capabilities_enum`.\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/sdk.go` - Implemented auto-discovery in `Supports`.\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/sdk_test.go` - Added integration tests.\n- `PLUGIN_DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md` - Added dual-layer discovery docs.\n\nCloses #194",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-15T06:33:21-06:00",
          "tree_id": "f91bd1dd6261be5755e9370adab5293e4f924148",
