          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f819c3efa695c65ce4f74e18bdcf2260d56455b3",
          "message": "feat(sdk): add typescript sdk for browser and node.js (#302)\n\n* feat(sdk): add typescript sdk for browser and node.js\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds a complete TypeScript SDK enabling browser-based cost analysis\nand Node.js REST API integration. The implementation provides three\nnpm packages: a lightweight browser client (16.8 KB gzipped),\nmiddleware for REST API wrapping, and framework adapters for Express,\nFastify, and NestJS.\n\nKey capabilities delivered:\n\n- Full browser compatibility using Connect protocol with JSON/HTTP\n  encoding\n- 22 RPC methods across CostSource, Observability, and Registry\n  services\n- Fluent builder APIs for ResourceDescriptor, RecommendationFilter,\n  and FOCUS 1.2/1.3 cost records\n- Async pagination with generator-based iteration\n- Comprehensive MSW-based integration tests covering all endpoints\n- Zero-config framework integration for popular Node.js web servers\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] All 24 implementation tasks completed per tasks.md\n- [x] Core client builds successfully (ESM: 100.2 KB, CJS: 106.3 KB\n      minified)\n- [x] Bundle size verified at 16.8 KB gzipped (well under 40 KB\n      target)\n- [x] Integration tests implemented with MSW mocks for all 22 RPC\n      methods\n- [x] Builder pattern tests validate fluent API and FOCUS compliance\n- [x] Error handling tests verify ValidationError behavior\n- [x] Generated protobuf code validated with buf v1.32.1\n\n## Changes\n\n### New directories\n\n- `sdk/typescript/` - Monorepo root with npm workspaces configuration\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/client/` - Browser/Node.js client\n  package\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/middleware/` - REST API gateway\n  middleware\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/framework-plugins/` -\n  Express/Fastify/NestJS adapters\n\n### New files (client package)\n\n- `packages/client/src/clients/cost-source.ts` - CostSourceClient\n  with 11 RPC methods and validation\n- `packages/client/src/clients/auxiliary.ts` - ObservabilityClient\n  and RegistryClient implementations\n- `packages/client/src/builders/resource-descriptor.ts` - Fluent\n  API for resource specification\n- `packages/client/src/builders/recommendation-filter.ts` - Filter\n  builder with 10+ fields\n- `packages/client/src/builders/focus-record.ts` - FOCUS 1.2/1.3\n  cost record builder\n- `packages/client/src/utils/pagination.ts` - Async generator for\n  paginated recommendations\n- `packages/client/src/errors/validation-error.ts` - Custom error\n  class with proper inheritance\n- `packages/client/src/index.ts` - Public API exports for all SDK\n  components\n- `packages/client/test/integration.test.ts` - Comprehensive\n  integration tests (23 test cases)\n- `packages/client/test/mocks/handlers.ts` - MSW handlers for all\n  22 RPC endpoints\n\n### New files (middleware package)\n\n- `packages/middleware/src/transport.ts` - Node.js Connect\n  transport factory with timeout support\n- `packages/middleware/src/gateway.ts` - RESTGateway for\n  JSON-to-RPC translation\n- `packages/middleware/src/index.ts` - Middleware package exports\n\n### New files (framework-plugins package)\n\n- `packages/framework-plugins/src/express/index.ts` - Express\n  middleware adapter\n- `packages/framework-plugins/src/fastify/index.ts` - Fastify\n  plugin implementation\n- `packages/framework-plugins/src/nestjs/index.ts` - NestJS module\n  with DI support\n- `packages/framework-plugins/src/index.ts` - Framework plugin exports\n\n### Configuration files\n\n- `sdk/typescript/package.json` - Workspace configuration with 3\n  packages\n- `sdk/typescript/tsconfig.base.json` - Shared TypeScript config\n  for ES2018 target\n- `sdk/typescript/buf.gen.yaml` - Protobuf generation for\n  TypeScript\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/client/package.json` - Client package\n  configuration\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/client/tsconfig.json` - Client\n  TypeScript config\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/middleware/package.json` - Middleware\n  package configuration\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/middleware/tsconfig.json` - Middleware\n  TypeScript config\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/framework-plugins/package.json` -\n  Framework plugins configuration\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/framework-plugins/tsconfig.json` -\n  Framework plugins TypeScript config\n\n### Modified files\n\n- `specs/028-typescript-sdk/tasks.md` - All 24 tasks marked as\n  completed\n\nCloses #293\n\n* docs: amend constitution to v1.4.0 (multi-language SDK synchronization)",
