          "message": "fix(sdk): complete typescript sdk builder api and improve error handling (#303) (#305)\n\nExtends the TypeScript SDK with complete RecommendationFilterBuilder\ncoverage (all 16 fields), improved REST gateway error handling that\ndistinguishes client errors (400) from server errors (500), and\nupdated Buf codegen plugins to latest stable versions. Also adds\ndocumentation improvements to Go conformance tests based on code\nreview feedback from the TypeScript SDK pull request.\n\n- [x] Go code compiles without errors\n- [x] `TestGetPluginInfoContextCancellation` passes\n- [ ] `make lint` passes\n- [ ] `make test` passes\n- [ ] TypeScript SDK builds successfully\n\n- `buf.gen.yaml` - Updated bufbuild/es v2.2.3→v2.7.0, connectrpc/es\n  v1.6.1→v2.1.1 for latest TypeScript codegen\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/client/src/builders/recommendation-filter.ts` -\n  Added 10 builder methods (withCategory, withSku, withTags, withSource,\n  withAccountId, withSortBy, withSortOrder, withMinConfidenceScore,\n  withMaxAgeDays, withResourceId) and updated build() to copy all 16 fields\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/middleware/src/gateway.ts` - Fixed JSON parse\n  errors to return 400 instead of 500; changed req.on('error') to respond\n  and resolve instead of reject to prevent unhandled promise rejections\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/conformance_test.go` - Added performance expectations\n  to BenchmarkInferCapabilities (<100 ns/op, 1 alloc/op) and detailed\n  rationale to TestGetPluginInfoContextCancellation explaining why it\n  succeeds with cancelled context",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-18T15:27:21-06:00",
