          "distinct": true,
          "id": "873201eee932ef219efaaadbeca9a92f87e6015c",
          "message": "fix(pluginsdk): improve capability discovery robustness (#306)\n\n- Add defensive nil check to `inferCapabilities` to prevent panics when\n  nil plugin is passed during error recovery or testing scenarios\n- Add edge case tests for invalid enum values and override precedence\n- Sync ROADMAP.md with GitHub reality (moved completed issues, added new bugs)\n\n- [x] `TestInferCapabilitiesNilPlugin` verifies nil handling\n- [x] `TestGetPluginInfoCapabilitiesInvalidEnumValue` verifies invalid enum (999) handled\n- [x] `TestGetPluginInfoCapabilitiesOverrideTakesPrecedence` verifies override beats auto-discovery\n- [x] All tests pass with race detector (`go test -race`)\n- [x] `golangci-lint run` passes with 0 issues\n- [x] `make test` passes\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/plugin_info.go` - Added nil check and updated documentation\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/conformance_test.go` - Added 3 new edge case tests\n- `ROADMAP.md` - Synced with GitHub, moved completed issues to done section\n\nCloses #296\nCloses #297",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-18T19:06:04-06:00",
