          "distinct": true,
          "id": "318eeb98ff70d2c560d467d59538a3dcd96b6ef9",
          "message": "feat(proto): add anomaly category and investigate action (#332)\n\n- Added `RECOMMENDATION_CATEGORY_ANOMALY` to classify cost anomalies\n- Added `RECOMMENDATION_ACTION_TYPE_INVESTIGATE` for human-required analysis\n- Updated Go and TypeScript SDKs with generated code for new enum values\n- Added comprehensive conformance tests for anomaly detection workflows\n- Updated MockPlugin to support realistic anomaly data generation\n- Enabled negative savings representation for cost overspend anomalies\n\n- [x] Completed validation steps\n- [x] `make lint` passes with zero issues\n- [x] `make test` passes\n- [x] Verified anomaly filtering and confidence scoring in conformance tests\n\n- `sdk/go/testing/anomaly_conformance_test.go` - Conformance tests for anomaly recommendations\n- `specs/040-anomaly-detection-recommendations/` - Feature specification and design docs\n\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.proto` - Added ANOMALY and INVESTIGATE enums\n- `sdk/go/proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.pb.go` - Generated Go code\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/client/src/generated/finfocus/v1/costsource_pb.ts` - Generated TS code\n- `sdk/go/testing/action_type_test.go` - Updated enum count test\n- `sdk/go/testing/mock_plugin.go` - Added anomaly sample generation logic\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Updated recent changes section\n\nCloses #315",
