          "distinct": true,
          "id": "890f230a77cb598066ce187e85fcf87e1ebda8b8",
          "message": "feat(proto): add pricing tier and risk score fields (#335)\n\n- Enables plugins to explain *why* a price is low (Spot vs. Reserved vs. On-Demand)\n- Adds `pricing_category` (Standard, Committed, Dynamic) to cost estimation responses\n- Adds `spot_interruption_risk_score` (0.0-1.0) to quantify reliability risks for spot instances\n- Updates both `EstimateCost` (pre-deployment) and `GetProjectedCost` (forecasting) RPCs\n- Ensures standardized downstream consumption for TUI warning icons and risk assessment\n\n- [x] Completed validation steps\n- [x] `make lint` passes with zero issues\n- [x] `make test` passes\n- [x] Verified `EstimateCostResponse` fields with `sdk/go/spot_risk_test.go`\n- [x] Verified `GetProjectedCostResponse` fields with `sdk/go/projected_cost_test.go`\n- [x] Confirmed TypeScript client SDK generation\n\n- `sdk/go/spot_risk_test.go` - Verifies EstimateCostResponse fields\n- `sdk/go/projected_cost_test.go` - Verifies GetProjectedCostResponse fields\n- `specs/041-pricing-tier-fields/` - Feature specification and implementation plan\n\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.proto` - Added fields to Estimate/Projected responses\n- `sdk/go/proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.pb.go` - Generated Go code\n- `.../client/src/generated/finfocus/v1/costsource_pb.ts` - Generated TS code\n\nCloses #217",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-24T11:38:38-06:00",
