          "distinct": true,
          "id": "5abd98c812868566b63a58eac89593bd83746091",
          "message": "feat(pricing): add validation bypass metadata for audit trails (#338)\n\n* feat(pricing): add validation bypass metadata for audit trails\n\n- Enables ValidationResult to carry metadata about bypassed validations\n  (e.g., when --yolo flag is used), providing audit trails that survive\n  stateless service boundaries via JSON serialization\n- Implements zero-allocation enum validation pattern (<10 ns/op) following\n  the established registry package optimization approach\n- Provides CLI display formatters and filter functions for compliance\n  reporting and historical analysis of bypass events\n\n- [x] `make test` passes - all unit and conformance tests pass\n- [x] `make lint` passes - 2 minor testpackage style warnings consistent\n      with existing codebase patterns\n- [x] Benchmarks verify <10 ns/op, 0 allocs/op performance targets\n- [x] Quickstart.md examples compile and execute correctly\n- [x] JSON round-trip serialization preserves all fields\n\n- `sdk/go/pricing/bypass.go` - BypassSeverity/BypassMechanism enums,\n  BypassMetadata struct, constructor with functional options, validation,\n  CLI formatters, and filter functions\n- `sdk/go/pricing/bypass_test.go` - Comprehensive test suite with enum\n  validation, constructor, truncation, JSON round-trip, and benchmark tests\n- `sdk/go/testing/bypass_conformance_test.go` - Conformance tests for JSON\n  compliance, cross-service boundary serialization, and backward compatibility\n\n- `sdk/go/pricing/observability.go` - Added Bypasses field to ValidationResult\n- `sdk/go/pricing/CLAUDE.md` - Added bypass metadata documentation\n- `specs/034-validation-bypass-metadata/tasks.md` - Marked all 45 tasks complete\n\nCloses #216\n\n* docs: Add docstrings to `034-validation-bypass-metadata` (#339)\n\nDocstrings generation was requested by @rshade.\n\n* https://github.com/rshade/finfocus-spec/pull/338#issuecomment-3795622941\n\nThe following files were modified:\n\n* `sdk/go/pricing/bypass.go`\n\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
