          "distinct": true,
          "id": "ae82f647590dde04d18a610c3bd3297bef7979c3",
          "message": "feat(proto): add usage profile enum for workload context signaling (#349)\n\n* feat(proto): add usage profile enum for workload context signaling\n\n## Summary\n\n- Enables Core to signal workload intent (DEV, PROD, BURST) to plugins\n  via `usage_profile` field on `GetProjectedCostRequest` (field 6) and\n  `GetRecommendationsRequest` (field 7)\n- Go SDK provides zero-allocation validation helpers, string parsing,\n  forward-compatible normalization, and `DefaultMonthlyHours()` convenience\n- `FocusRecordBuilder.WithProfileDefaults()` integrates profile context\n  into FOCUS cost records in a single builder call\n- TypeScript SDK mirrors Go helpers with full parity (Constitution XIII)\n- Conformance tests cover all profiles, unknown value handling, backward\n  compatibility (FR-005), and DryRun profile simulation (FR-007)\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `go test ./sdk/go/...` passes (13 packages, 0 failures)\n- [x] `npx vitest run` passes (31 TypeScript tests)\n- [x] Benchmark: `IsValidUsageProfile` at 8 ns/op, 0 allocs (target <15)\n- [x] `TestOldPluginReceivesProfileRequests` validates FR-005 backward compat\n- [x] `TestDryRunWithUsageProfile` validates FR-007 profile simulation\n- [x] `npm run lint:markdown` — no new errors (9 pre-existing)\n\n## Changes\n\n### New files\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/usage_profile.go` — Go helpers (validate, parse,\n  normalize, default hours)\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/usage_profile_test.go` — Table-driven tests and\n  benchmarks\n- `sdk/go/testing/usage_profile_conformance_test.go` — Conformance,\n  backward compat, and benchmark tests\n- `sdk/typescript/.../utils/usage-profile.ts` — TypeScript helpers\n- `sdk/typescript/.../test/usage-profile.test.ts` — TypeScript tests\n- `specs/042-usage-profile-context/` — Full spec, plan, tasks, data\n  model, research, quickstart\n\n### Modified files\n\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/enums.proto` — Added `UsageProfile` enum\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.proto` — Added `usage_profile` fields\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/focus_builder.go` — `WithProfileDefaults()` method\n- `sdk/go/testing/dry_run_conformance_test.go` — DryRun profile test\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/README.md` — FR-007 DryRun profile documentation\n- `sdk/typescript/.../src/index.ts` — Exported usage profile helpers\n- `CLAUDE.md` — Usage Profile SDK patterns\n\nCloses #218\n\n* fix: add docstrings to `042-usage-profile-context` (#351)\n\nDocstrings generation was requested by @rshade.\n\n* https://github.com/rshade/finfocus-spec/pull/349#issuecomment-3815134941\n\nThe following files were modified:\n\n* `sdk/go/pluginsdk/usage_profile.go`\n* `sdk/typescript/packages/client/src/utils/usage-profile.ts`\n\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
