          "distinct": true,
          "id": "7e759b423d03f2b702b978716778a4e889c8b75c",
          "message": "docs(sdk): fix documentation drift across readme and sdk packages (#352)\n\n- Fixed ConformanceResult API documentation that was using outdated struct\n  fields (`FailedCount`, `TotalTests`) instead of actual `Summary.Failed/Total`\n- Updated all code examples to use `result.Passed()` method and correct field\n  access patterns so examples actually compile\n- Created new README.md files for mapping/ and registry/ packages\n- Corrected RPC count (8 → 11) and example count (10/8 → 9) in root README\n- Added Response Builders documentation section to pluginsdk/README.md\n\n- [x] `make lint-markdown` passes with zero errors (414 files linted)\n- [x] `make test` passes for all packages\n- [x] Verified all version references show v0.5.4\n- [x] Verified RPC count matches proto (11 CostSourceService methods)\n- [x] Verified example count matches files (9 in examples/specs/)\n- [x] Verified godoc coverage for pluginsdk (127 exports) and pricing (80 exports)\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/mapping/README.md` - Documents AWS, Azure, GCP property\n  extraction helpers\n\n- `README.md` - RPC counts, example counts, SDK helper usage examples\n- `sdk/go/testing/README.md` - Fixed ConformanceResult struct docs and all\n  conformance examples to handle error returns\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/README.md` - Added Response Builders and Validation section\n- `sdk/go/testing/CLAUDE.md` - Fixed conformance example to match actual API\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Fixed conformance example, markdown formatting\n- `specs/043-docs-drift-audit/tasks.md` - Marked all 42 tasks complete\n\nCloses #346\nCloses #347\nCloses #348",
