          "distinct": true,
          "id": "698cbe326ef326499b8c6b4d20d451eb9926c1c0",
          "message": "feat(currency): add symbol support and amount formatting (#357)\n\nAdds currency symbol support to the existing `sdk/go/currency/` package,\nenabling plugins to display monetary amounts with proper symbols, decimal\nprecision based on ISO 4217 MinorUnits, and thousands separators. This\neliminates duplicated symbol lookup code across FinFocus plugins.\n\n- [x] All existing currency tests pass\n- [x] New symbol tests pass (GetSymbol, FormatAmount, FormatAmountNoSymbol)\n- [x] Benchmarks meet targets (GetSymbol <55 ns/op, 0 allocs)\n- [x] `make lint` passes with zero issues\n- [x] `make test` passes\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/symbol.go` - GetSymbol(), FormatAmount(),\n  FormatAmountNoSymbol() helper functions with thousands separator support\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/symbol_test.go` - Comprehensive tests for symbol lookup\n  and amount formatting edge cases\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/currency.go` - Added Symbol field to Currency struct,\n  updated all 180 currency entries with symbols (empty for currencies\n  without commonly used symbols like CHF, XAU, XDR)\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/currency_test.go` - Added TestCurrency_Symbol and\n  TestGetCurrency_SymbolCopy tests\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/benchmark_test.go` - Added BenchmarkGetSymbol,\n  BenchmarkFormatAmount, and BenchmarkFormatAmountNoSymbol\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/doc.go` - Updated package documentation with symbol\n  and formatting examples\n\n- `sdk/go/currency/CLAUDE.md` - Updated with new functions and patterns\n\n- `sdk/go/CLAUDE.md` - Updated currency package description and usage\n  examples",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-04T19:20:15-06:00",
