          "message": "feat(proto): add expires_at caching hint to cost results (#382)\n\n* feat(proto): add expires_at caching hint to cost results\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds optional `google.protobuf.Timestamp expires_at` field to\n  `ActualCostResult` (field 8) and `GetProjectedCostResponse`\n  (field 13) for plugin-driven cache management\n- Enables plugins to signal data freshness duration, helping\n  callers avoid redundant API calls to rate-limited upstream\n  billing APIs\n- Provides four zero-allocation Go SDK helper functions for\n  checking expiration and extracting TTL values\n- Includes `WithProjectedCostExpiresAt` functional option for\n  building projected cost responses with caching hints\n- Fully backward compatible: unset field means no caching\n  guidance, existing plugins work without modification\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `make test` passes (all packages)\n- [x] `make lint` passes (0 new issues)\n- [x] `npx tsc --noEmit` passes for TypeScript SDK\n- [x] Unit tests cover nil, past, future, and exact boundary\n- [x] 7 conformance tests validate gRPC round-trip behavior\n- [x] Backward compatibility test confirms nil when duration=0\n- [x] Benchmarks confirm 0 allocs/op for all helper functions\n- [x] Markdown linting passes\n\n## Changes\n\n### New files\n\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/expires_at.go` - Four helper functions:\n  `IsActualCostExpired`, `ActualCostExpiresAt`,\n  `IsProjectedCostExpired`, `ProjectedCostExpiresAt`\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/expires_at_test.go` - Table-driven unit\n  tests for all helpers with edge cases\n- `sdk/go/testing/expires_at_conformance_test.go` - Seven\n  conformance tests: round-trip, backward compat, past\n  timestamp, per-result consistency, projected cost variants\n- `specs/045-caching-hint-expires-at/` - Feature specification,\n  plan, research, data model, and task tracking\n\n### Modified files\n\n- `proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.proto` - Added `expires_at`\n  field to `ActualCostResult` and `GetProjectedCostResponse`\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/helpers.go` - Added\n  `WithProjectedCostExpiresAt` functional option\n- `sdk/go/proto/finfocus/v1/costsource.pb.go` - Regenerated\n  protobuf Go code\n- `sdk/go/testing/mock_plugin.go` - Added `ExpiresAtDuration`\n  and `ProjectedCostExpiresAtDuration` configuration fields\n- `sdk/go/testing/benchmark_test.go` - Added benchmarks for\n  helper functions and RPC overhead comparison\n- `sdk/go/pluginsdk/README.md` - Added caching hint\n  documentation with usage examples and behavior table\n- `sdk/typescript/packages/client/src/generated/finfocus/v1/costsource_pb.ts` -\n  Regenerated TypeScript types with `expiresAt` field\n\nCloses #380\n\n* fix: review items",
